               </span>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n        <div className=\"bg-white dark800 flex relative z-20 items-center overflow-hidden\">\n            <div className=\"container mx-auto px-6 flex relative py-16\">\n                <div className=\"sm2/3 lg2/5 flex flex-col relative z-20\">\n                    <span className=\"w-20 h-2 bg-gray-800 dark mb-12\">\n                    </span>\n                    <h1\n                        className=\"font-bebas-neue uppercase text-6xl sm8xl font-black flex flex-col leading-none dark text-gray-800\">\n                        Be on\n                        <span className=\"text-5xl sm7xl\">\n                            Time\n                        </span>\n                    </h1>\n                    <p className=\"text-sm sm text-gray-700 dark\">\n                        Dimension of reality that makes change possible and understandable. An indefinite and homogeneous\n                        environment in which natural events and human existence take place.\n                    </p>\n                    <div className=\"flex mt-8\">\n                        <a href=\"#\"\n                            className=\"uppercase py-2 px-4 rounded-lg bg-pink-500 border-2 border-transparent text-white text-md mr-4 hover400\">\n                            Get started\n                        </a>\n                        <a href=\"#\"\n                            className=\"uppercase py-2 px-4 rounded-lg bg-transparent border-2 border-pink-500 text-pink-500 dark hover500 hover text-md\">\n                            Read more\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div className=\"hidden sm sm1/3 lg3/5 relative\">\n                    <img src=\"https://www.tailwind-kit.com/images/object/10.png\" className=\"max-w-xs md m-auto\"/>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n",
